.Dd July 9, 2026
.Dt AUDITD 8
.Os GergiOS
.Sh NAME
.Nm auditd
.Nd security event auditing daemon
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm auditd
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
is the system security audit daemon for GergiOS. It periodically polls
the kernel's audit ring buffer via the
.Xr SYS_AUDIT 2
system call, writing events to the audit log.
.Pp
.Nm
is started automatically by the reincarnation server (RS) at boot time,
as configured in
.Pa /etc/system.conf .
.Pp
The daemon supports the following operations, triggered by IPC messages
from
.Xr auditctl 8 :
.Bl -tag -width indent
.It Sy Status
Returns audit log state, enabled status, and poll interval.
.It Sy Enable/Disable
Toggles audit logging on or off.
.It Sy Force poll
Immediately reads the kernel ring buffer.
.It Sy Reopen log
Closes and reopens the log file (for external log rotation).
.It Sy Force rotation
Triggers log rotation by size/time check.
.El
.Sh CONFIGURATION
Configuration is read from
.Pa /etc/auditd.conf :
.Bd -literal -offset indent
# Audit log path
log_path = /var/log/audit/audit.log

# Poll interval in milliseconds (default: 10000)
poll_interval_ms = 10000

# Rotate when log exceeds this size (default: 10 MB)
rotate_size_mb = 10

# Rotate every N seconds (default: 3600 = 1 hour)
rotate_interval_s = 3600

# Delete logs older than N days (default: 30)
max_days = 30
.Ed
.Sh LOG ROTATION
.Nm
supports automatic log rotation triggered by either:
.Bl -bullet -compact
.It
Log file size exceeding
.Nm rotate_size_mb .
.It
Time elapsed since last rotation exceeding
.Nm rotate_interval_s .
.El
.Pp
Rotated logs are named
.Pa audit.log.YYYYMMDD_HHMMSS .
Old logs are automatically cleaned up after
.Nm max_days .
.Pp
The kernel ring buffer holds 1024 entries regardless of rotation state.
Overflow discards the oldest entries.
.Sh LOG FORMAT
The log is pipe-delimited text:
.Bd -literal -offset indent
serial|ticks|type|result|subject|object|extra
.Ed
.Pp
Event types:
.Bl -column "AUDIT_MAC_VIOLATION" "Value" "Description" -offset indent
.It Sy Type Ta Value Ta Description
.It AUTH_SUCCESS Ta 0 Ta Successful authentication
.It AUTH_FAILURE Ta 1 Ta Failed authentication
.It PRIV_CHANGE Ta 2 Ta Capability/privilege change
.It IPC_DENIED Ta 3 Ta IPC send denied
.It FILE_DENIED Ta 4 Ta File access denied
.It DEVICE_BIND Ta 5 Ta Device bound/unbound
.It SYSCALL_AUTH Ta 6 Ta Kernel call authorised
.It MAC_VIOLATION Ta 7 Ta MAC policy violation
.It SERVICE_START Ta 8 Ta Service started/stopped
.It SERVICE_CRASH Ta 9 Ta Service crash
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width /var/log/audit/audit.log -compact
.It Pa /etc/auditd.conf
Configuration file.
.It Pa /var/log/audit/audit.log
Audit log file.
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr auditctl 8 ,
.Xr audit2txt 8 ,
.Xr audit 2 ,
.Xr system.conf 5 ,
.Xr macd 8
.Sh HISTORY
The
.Nm
daemon first appeared in GergiOS 1.0.
